# Guide stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Simian Spirit Guide
Duress
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Binding Negotiation
Swamp x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Simian Spirit Guide.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Binding Negotiation.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Choose()
Bot2.Choose()

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Simian Spirit Guide
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Graveyard = Binding Negotiation
